      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791554234765,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Prvent double payment (Use Idempotency)\n2. Correctness > latency > availability\n3. Scalability (1000 TPS)\n\n----Out of scope----\n\nCompliance (PCI Compliant)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Prvent double payment (Use Idempotency)\n2. Correctness > latency > availability\n3. Scalability (1000 TPS)\n\n----Out of scope----\n\nCompliance (PCI Compliant)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
